{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["relation/2882852"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 200 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Chennai. These are the hull of the port area below grown by 200 m, cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the port area kept whole and a 30 m margin where it meets the water. What is left is the port, its docks and the outer harbour inside the breakwaters; Fort St George, George Town and Royapuram are outside. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no homes, hospitals, places of worship or named places inside. The margin along the port's landward wall takes in the edges of two unnamed residential areas and of a school's grounds, about 800 m² in all, none of it more than 40 m inside the limits.","inside":{"houses":0,"residential_m2":668,"residential":[{"osm":"way/127291325","m2":461},{"osm":"way/127291324","m2":207}],"amenities":0}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[80.293854,13.077684],[80.292825,13.075322],[80.294137,13.077643],[80.291949,13.072481],[80.290122,13.068671],[80.304865,13.089045],[80.311849,13.10666],[80.311988,13.107449],[80.311847,13.108137],[80.311406,13.108805],[80.300886,13.123507],[80.300534,13.122985],[80.300209,13.121292],[80.30001,13.121788],[80.299954,13.121209],[80.299886,13.121368],[80.299508,13.122351],[80.299497,13.122357],[80.299269,13.122208],[80.299261,13.122077],[80.299225,13.121799],[80.299205,13.121717],[80.299325,13.121419],[80.298822,13.121132],[80.298861,13.120981],[80.297081,13.116107],[80.296826,13.116158],[80.296766,13.115959],[80.296348,13.11402],[80.296355,13.114013],[80.296661,13.113944],[80.296638,13.113764],[80.296642,13.113756],[80.297344,13.113595],[80.297295,13.11339],[80.296